@startuml tracker-common-i18n
title tracker-common — i18n message resolution

start
:Code requests Messages.get(code, args...);
:Read language from UserLocaleContext\n(or explicit AppLanguage);
:Load ResourceBundle i18n/messages_{en|uk};
:MessageFormat with arguments;
:Return localized string for UI;

note right
  Logs must NOT use Messages —
  logs are always English.
end note
stop

@enduml
